WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
An audio recording can give you a ritual.
But a format is not an experiment.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
To test a claim, ask what happened to listeners—
and what happened in the comparison group.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Feeling quieter matters.
It is not the same thing as making fewer mistakes.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
An old signed account can tell us what someone reported,
without proving the cause.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve minutes, record what you did,
and keep the unanswered question.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then read the evidence
before you consider buying the sound.
